Privacy Policy for Habity

Last updated: 19 November 2026.

Habity is published by KAWI SOFTWARE AS, Norway ("we"). Contact: andreas@kawisoftware.com.

What stays on your device
Your habits, check-ins, streak, drops, trophies, the name you give your companion and your
settings are stored on your device only. Habity has no account and no sign-up, and we do not
receive this content. If you delete the app, this data is deleted with it.

What we collect
- Usage analytics (PostHog). Anonymous events about how the app is used, for example that
  a habit was completed, an onboarding step was viewed or a screen was opened, together with
  device type, operating system version, app version, language and country. Events are tied to
  a random identifier created on your device. They do not contain habit names or anything you type.
- Purchases (Apple, Google and RevenueCat). Purchases are processed by the App Store or
  Google Play. We use RevenueCat to check whether a subscription is active. RevenueCat receives a
  random app user identifier, the product bought, the time and the store receipt. We never see
  your card or payment details.

We do not show ads, we do not sell personal data, and we do not track you across other
companies' apps or websites.

Notifications
If you allow notifications, reminders are scheduled on your device. No notification content is
sent to us.

Why we process this data
To run and improve the app (legitimate interest) and to deliver what you buy (contract).

How long we keep it
Analytics events are kept for up to 24 months. Purchase records are kept as long as accounting
rules require.

Your rights
Depending on where you live, you can ask for access to, correction of or deletion of personal
data we hold about you, and you can object to processing. Write to the contact address above.
You can also complain to your data protection authority (in Norway: Datatilsynet).

Children
Habity is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their personal data.

Changes
We will post changes on this page and update the date above.
